Only the people who need access to the critical systems have it, and privileged access is protected with multi-factor authentication.

== How to decide if this control is required

This control is required when the organisation runs IT or cloud services itself, or administers the accounts of the services that it uses.

== How to implement

Review the user accounts and the access rights of the critical systems at least once a year, and the privileged rights more often. Remove the access of people who have left. Make sure that multi-factor authentication is on for remote and privileged access.

